  <!-- EN: legacy flak gun -->
  <DMSE_Turret_LegacyFlak.label>老式防空砲</DMSE_Turret_LegacyFlak.label>
  <!-- EN: A crew-served 37 mm anti-aircraft autocannon based on the 3.7 cm Flak 43. Its gas-operated action feeds from eight-round clips; a gunner turns the handwheels and aims through an optical sight. Small high-explosive shells and rapid bursts make it useful against slow, low-flying targets, but it has no radar, electrical drive or automatic fire control.\n\nNeeds a gunner. Fires steel-supplied 37 mm rounds at ground targets and at incoming missiles in their final approach. Requires Radar and gas operation research. -->
  <DMSE_Turret_LegacyFlak.description>一門以 3.7 cm Flak 43 為原型的 37 毫米防空機砲。氣動式自動機構由 8 發彈夾供彈，砲手以手輪轉向並透過光學瞄準具計算提前量。小型高爆彈配合快速連射，適合對付低空慢速目標；沒有雷達、電動驅動或自動火控。\n\n需要砲手操作。以鋼補充 37 毫米砲彈，可射擊地面目標與進入最後進場階段的來襲導彈。需要雷達與氣動作用科技。</DMSE_Turret_LegacyFlak.description>
