  <DMSE_Turret_LegacyFlak.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>37毫米砲彈</DMSE_Turret_LegacyFlak.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
  <!-- EN: 37 mm rounds -->
  <DMSE_Turret_LegacyFlak.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>37毫米砲彈</DMSE_Turret_LegacyFlak.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
  <!-- EN: Cannot fire: no shells. -->
  <DMSE_Turret_LegacyFlak.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>無法開火：沒有砲彈。</DMSE_Turret_LegacyFlak.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>
  
  <!-- EN: advanced air-defence gun -->
  <DMSE_Turret_Millennium.label>先進防空砲</DMSE_Turret_Millennium.label>
  <!-- EN: A modern 35 mm anti-aircraft gun with programmable airburst ammunition, radar and electro-optical tracking and a fire-control system that engages several targets at once, its interception rate startling and so is its draw on power and ammunition, every engagement a crate of silver poured into the sky.\n\nFires airburst rounds made from steel; each terminal-defence burst burns through dozens of them. -->
  <DMSE_Turret_Millennium.description>一門 35 毫米的現代化防空砲，配備可編程空爆彈、雷達與光電追蹤以及一套能同時接戰多目標的火控系統，攔截率高得驚人，代價是驚人的耗電與彈藥消耗，每一次接戰都像把一整箱白銀倒進天空。\n\n以鋼材製作的空爆彈開火；每一輪末端防禦連射都會燒掉數十發。</DMSE_Turret_Millennium.description>
